# /watch-pr-approve (Cursor)

Arm a background watcher for human GitHub Approve on one or more PRs
(`owner/repo#N`), then on wake: resolve conflicts if needed, triage review
comments (reply + resolve), merge, and continue. Follow the `pr-approve-watch`
skill (`.claude/skills/pr-approve-watch/SKILL.md` or
`.cursor/skills/pr-approve-watch/SKILL.md`). Pass PR refs from the user or
from PRs you just opened.

Chat `notify_on_output` is best-effort — drain `AGENT_LOOP_WAKE_pr_approve`
from the watcher terminal when Approve happens but the chat stays quiet.
